<header><p class="enc-kicker">Institution</p><h1 class="enc-title">Gukjagam</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates"><a href="/years/992">992</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/10th-century">10th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Gukjagam was the national Confucian academy of the Korean kingdom of Goryeo, founded in 992 by King Seongjong in the capital <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kaesong">Kaegyong</a>. It trained the sons of officials in the Confucian classics for the civil service. Renamed several times, it became the Seonggyungwan, the highest educational institution of the Joseon dynasty.</p></div>
